# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source data is NOT redistributable and is NOT in this repository.
#
# ACLED's terms restrict redistribution outright. UCDP GED, IDMC GIDD and the
# UNHCR exports are large and carry their own citation and licence conditions.
# Everyone running this downloads them directly from the source - see
# docs/getting_the_data.md. That is a licence requirement, not a preference.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
